{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_title", "source_sha256": "8a25cfba280d88e97c622ad5cff6fecab3470da2f2ab8e54990c9379c85195ef", "ja": "私とあなたのプリンセス", "zh": "我和你的公主", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b656a9edb4dbbe2f6b508692172be208f982ef72e384474abf538fb1db419247", "ja": "歌劇のオーディションを受けたアイドル達。\nお姫様をテーマにした伝統的な劇で、まつり\nは最終選考に残る。課題をどう演じるか悩む\nまつりだったが、仲間たちやナイト様の助け\nで答えを得、見事合格を勝ち取るのだった。", "zh": "参加歌剧试镜的偶像们。\n在这部以公主为主题的传统戏剧中，茉莉\n进入了最终选拔。面对课题该如何演绎，\n茉莉虽然感到苦恼，但在伙伴们与骑士大人的\n帮助下找到了答案，精彩地赢得了合格资格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4dbbd249fc95dbc00421b79768b83f2e5abff462657b675edfd784a3a31fe5d5", "ja": "（定期公演が終わって数日。劇場にて、\n打ち上げという名のティーパーティーが開かれた！）", "zh": "（定期公演结束几天后，剧场里举办了一场名为庆功宴的茶会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "44f0ff925edcc2bd2cf2dcea61ba4847b5bcf090deac1341ba441f7fef914142", "ja": "それにしても、まつりんの公演、\nほんっと～～～にステキだったよね！？", "zh": "话说回来，小茉莉的公演真的～～～特别棒，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "70a46024a141ed0740f77425108f4059fa1e9265c91b64f3e11300bcc81b2ca7", "ja": "はい！　とっても優雅で、綺麗で……。\n一緒に舞台に立てたことを、光栄に思います！", "zh": "是的！真的非常优雅、美丽……能和她一起登上舞台，我感到无比荣幸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "03997487c333ac064230e37928f9e2aca7cedea5ad306bc661f9589756a13989", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、それはお互いさまなのです。\n姫もみんなと一緒で、とっても楽しかったのですよ。", "zh": "艾米莉，这也是彼此彼此啦。\n小公主和大家一起，也玩得特别开心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1004_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1005_p", "source_sha256": "903e3a6cf01c7568f12128a2b1c320fd1781a37973d4ed1156a96758ee9a997a", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！\n打ち上げ、盛り上がってるみたいだな。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n庆功宴好像挺热闹的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "064e75be6d3e085de4e89b46ad53b305634b9b0258af94e01efe95f29561b76c", "ja": "兄ちゃん、遅ーい！　お菓子、もうほとんどないよ？\n真美のビスケット、ひとかけら食べる？", "zh": "哥哥，你也太晚啦！零食都快没了哦？\n要不要吃一小块真美的饼干？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "2b39b6fb423aa047b47928ef9d78f52d8facdb87ccfe43cd55bd184e162238db", "ja": "{$P$}。後で飲もうと思って、\nとっておいたジュースをどうぞ……乾杯。", "zh": "{$P$}。这是我想待会儿喝，特意留着的果汁，请用……干杯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1008_p", "source_sha256": "007fcb2734df1a4c59ff155c72b19df380bb08c1435f39880e2c2fa8e7a8c004", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。\nでもその前に……まつり、ちょっと時間いいかな。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。\n不过在那之前……小祭，能占用你一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "b25577c75a6c930405155d1d64e778770784750704da1541977000c567c034b9", "ja": "ほ？", "zh": "哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1010_p", "source_sha256": "479a85ef173a99e5586aba0a1ab574afe2bbffc4f0d67fb5496fd2b999bc2bb9", "ja": "最終選考の結果が届いたんだ。\n事務室で話そうか。", "zh": "最终选拔的结果出来了。\n去办公室谈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "fbc7963e526da5389f74dbff3979a2473c1e2580cd22e68f05801ce0b30bdc73", "ja": "はっ！　ついに……！", "zh": "啊！终于……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "24e705a171e44f82c08ac51d72faeb9ad900fca8288ed90c2e99e58fb19b149a", "ja": "……。{$P$}さん、\nここで、みんなと一緒に聞かせてもらっていいのです？", "zh": "……。{$P$}先生，可以让我和大家一起在这里听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "f45185884965f2bb5cce949f01a8da7b2f3180dcdf76428088025ae26f393898", "ja": "オーディションは、このメンバーで受けたのです。\nなので、最後まで一緒に。……ね？", "zh": "试镜是由我们这些成员一起参加的。\n所以，要一起走到最后……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1014_p", "source_sha256": "68252a3d8c94e5982109cdc8fbeb0659885fa6248f581944074e5b595e2c8dfc", "ja": "わかった。それじゃ……コホン。\nまつりのオーディション、最終選考の結果は……。", "zh": "我明白了。那么……咳咳。\n小公主的试镜，最终选拔的结果是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1019_p", "source_sha256": "56ba8d70c4171f16ec04849a5aad15e2c5bc57144c5ee28956449c14f2987451", "ja": "……合格だ！\nプリンセス役、おめでとう、まつり！", "zh": "……合格了！\n恭喜你，茉莉！你获得了公主一角！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "c808d9e6ab4d9e60d8a69d856db94fd79693f5130b6c03860a0cde72da9988d6", "ja": "Wow！　まつりさん、Congratulatio……\nはっ！？　私、はしゃぎすぎて、つい……！", "zh": "Wow！　茉莉小姐，Congratulatio……\n哈！？我一激动，就不小心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "a0637bc830dacb3020ffdea19ee01b353247e89365c75165fc98686a80d5166e", "ja": "やったやった、やったねまつりん！\nすごいすごい！　プリンセスだ～！！", "zh": "太好了太好了，恭喜你小祭！\n好厉害好厉害！是公主呀～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "c2ea85b0c1c0ce37f9ce1583154d58115131155fd0cce597d38e1dbdba983627", "ja": "信じていました。徳川さんならやれると。\nですが、やっぱり……感無量です。ぐすん。", "zh": "我一直相信，德川小姐一定能做到。不过，果然还是……百感交集。呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "b7b7548a0e7156d8d86f4e0a708827c987ce032507a246b616b48845e9a4f158", "ja": "みんな……、ありがとうなのです。\n一緒に喜んでもらえて、とっても嬉しいのです。", "zh": "大家……谢谢你们呢。\n能和大家一起开心，茉莉真的非常高兴哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1024_p", "source_sha256": "fe266342a20476837b8b092cb6a23a027c0b9f7af2a28e096085521771da8a46", "ja": "まつり、なんだか落ち着いてるな。\nもしかして……自信があったのか？", "zh": "茉莉，感觉你挺冷静的嘛。\n难道说……你原本就很有信心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "0a26c753eb96383691b2310275d0b45a20c4ba205f8e97bd0d4f4b91e079e331", "ja": "ほ？　そんなことないのです！\n今だって、姫のハートはドキドキなのです！", "zh": "诶？才不是那样呢！\n现在人家的心脏也还在怦怦直跳呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "c020eeb2a804e50161b89b189a382b72be4898a76c6f8d61eaa7288f16219807", "ja": "ただ……どうなったとしても、悔いはなかったから。\nそれだけなのですよ。", "zh": "只是……因为不管结果如何，我都没有遗憾。\n仅此而已哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1027_012mam", "source_sha256": "b4618a1e250b68bae91ed2526e1cf9ab00337357170880a1a159d7239d2bc85e", "ja": "はいはい、セーシュクに！　打ち上げは終了ーっ！\nここからは『合格パーティー』のはじまりね！！", "zh": "好啦好啦，都安静点！庆功宴结束——！\n接下来就是“合格派对”的开始啦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1028_p", "source_sha256": "8aa1009dce037c53ec662c2d205ec02256aea1ad0fb362a0ff570cfb5ca7442b", "ja": "おっ、いいじゃないか。じゃあ追加のお菓子と\nジュースの買い出し行ってくるよ。待っててくれ。", "zh": "哦，不错嘛。那我去买些额外的点心和果汁。等我回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "680c91fb85c0c9d7e9452b40c36fa7d210779db0ae2ac1c4412622e41ee262d4", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n待ってください、姫も一緒に行くのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n请等一下，公主也要一起去哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1030_p", "source_sha256": "36091fdcbba8dbf3fb5512845b6ee4129e6d63ed43867c93a47d8a9d05d19b71", "ja": "えっ？　まつりが来ちゃったらダメじゃないか。\nパーティーの主役なのに。", "zh": "诶？要是小祭也来了，不就不行了吗？\n明明是派对的主角。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "fb641d77b7e3b44ff823efc306a4036f526d52cc7d69ec8f19da55740056aa80", "ja": "ううん、お返ししたいのです。この結果は、みんなと\n{$P$}さんのおかげなのです。", "zh": "不，茉莉想要报答大家。能有这个结果，都是多亏了大家和{$P$}先生呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1032_p", "source_sha256": "1f40fdb9d141e1bfed6bdc2d86c3d1fdefd3a4554cb26b625849443378319650", "ja": "いや、誰よりも、まつり本人が努力した結果で\n間違いないよ。ちゃんと見てたから。", "zh": "不，这毫无疑问比任何人都更是茉莉\n自己努力得来的成果。因为我一直都看在眼里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "0f8f46b141af86f004d4eb8b6b0ae47f86b156c41c6dad4c2d837ada7b24a3c4", "ja": "……。{$P$}さんは、\n本当に……ズルいのです。", "zh": "……。{$P$}先生\n真是……太狡猾了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1034_p", "source_sha256": "f919db5425670bdadba43029b205a88b758e485872c7fb5875946c686b948396", "ja": "え、そうかな……？", "zh": "诶，是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1035_021mat", "source_sha256": "0a2f2995c1f9676e1c176f744cfae8c975bacf7012320f4f7364a52ffd5c677d", "ja": "もういいのです！　そんなことよりも、今は\nお菓子の国にれっつごー！なのです♪", "zh": "不用再管啦！比起那个，现在\n就要出发去点心王国咯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1036_p", "source_sha256": "7ea68270e4bd8d2f60bcbb39ad3ab74293ad5e86b6775807758f4befb3d28267", "ja": "（そう言って駆け出したまつりの足取りは、\n羽根のように軽やかだった）", "zh": "（说完这些，跑出去的茉莉脚步轻盈得像羽毛一样。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_138_1037_p", "source_sha256": "f2e20283d86c621c71866c34708103e3b6b0187aabccf479c8048af611fd8a5b", "ja": "（かつて、舞踏会に向かう全てのお姫様たちが、\nそうであったかのように……）", "zh": "（就像过去所有前往舞会的公主们，都是那样轻盈地迈步一样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
